  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>Your enemy spears your foot near the ankle, his weapon crunching in among tarsal bones, ligaments, tendons and nerves, making a right proper mess of that delicate structure.</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> You gain @Condition[Prone] and @Condition[Stunned] (1). You also suffer a @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.7mCcI3q7hgWcmbBU]{Broken Bone (Minor)}, except that Surgery will be required within a week or you’ll have a lamed foot (see under @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.gz2xy41OSVZ8YBgI]{Amputated Parts}). Otherwise you’ll automatically lose function in 1d10/2 toes instead (see under @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.ZhMADOqoo0y8Q9bx]{Amputated Parts}).</p>"
    },
